# Local notes and editor/tooling config; not part of the distribution.
CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.md
.claude/

# pi-gen build artifacts
pi-gen/work/
pi-gen/deploy/
pi-gen/build.log
pi-gen/logs/

# Airgap payloads (download-assets.sh regenerates them).
